    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d231">

                <pb facs="0288" n="270" xml:id="pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.00/7–2246</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of State to
                        President Truman</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-07-12">July 12, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I hand you herewith a memorandum on the Argentine situation<anchor n="65"
                        xml:id="d231-f1"/> prepared by Assistant Secretary Braden pursuant to your
                    suggestion during your recent talk with him.</p>
                <p>I have read the memorandum and recommend it for your approval.</p>


                <xi:include href="d231-a1.xml" xpointer="d231-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
